    Policy and its own redistribution requirements.
    https://github.com/facebookresearch/vggt/blob/main/LICENSE.txt

  facebook/VGGT-1B weights
    CC BY-NC 4.0. NON-COMMERCIAL USE ONLY.
    https://huggingface.co/facebook/VGGT-1B

  Commercial use
    Requires the separately granted facebook/VGGT-1B-Commercial checkpoint.
    https://huggingface.co/facebook/VGGT-1B-Commercial

Running this service against the default checkpoint in a commercial product
would breach the weights' licence. Wrapping the model in an API does not
change which checkpoint you are running.
